OL,3,GNEWSAArts council designation for
OL,4,AThomas Hardy collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum's collection of Thomas Hardy
OL,7,Fmaterial has been awarded Arts Council
OL,8,FEngland (ACE) Designation status.
OL,10,FDorset Museum & Art Gallery in
OL,11,FDorchester is though to own the world's
OL,12,Flargest and most important archive of
OL,13,Fthe novelist and poet's work.
OL,15,FThe designation "recognises and
OL,16,Fcelebrates collections of national and
OL,17,Finternational importance based on their
OL,18,Fquality and significance".
